{"timestamp":1774797155639,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"4a5e21fb-0abe-4aeb-8d0e-c6d82d1693aa","hook_event_type":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_015eiMfXwq8RwVRvCCfhCLsp","payload":{"session_id":"4a5e21fb-0abe-4aeb-8d0e-c6d82d1693aa","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-harness-apps-mas-trees-adw-eb3c3e0b/4a5e21fb-0abe-4aeb-8d0e-c6d82d1693aa.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/adw-eb3c3e0b","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/adw-eb3c3e0b/specs/issue-3-adw-eb3c3e0b-sdlc_planner-fix-accessibility-violations.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/adw-eb3c3e0b/specs/issue-3-adw-eb3c3e0b-sdlc_planner-fix-accessibility-violations.md","content":"# Plan: Fix Accessibility issues on /products/catalog.html - ARIA roles and missing aria-labels\n\n## Summary\nFix accessibility violations on the products catalog page by adding missing aria-label attributes to the Special Offers link and resolving ARIA role hierarchy violations in the sidenav components.\n\n## Bug Description\nThe /products/catalog.html page has accessibility violations that impact screen reader users:\n1. Special Offers link in the Resources section lacks proper aria-label for screen readers\n2. ARIA role hierarchy violations where certain elements don't have required parent/child role relationships\n3. Screen readers cannot properly identify link targets and navigation structure\n\n## Root Cause\nThe accessibility violations originate from two sources:\n1. **Missing aria-label**: The Special Offers link in the sidenav Resources section (`sp-sidenav-item href=\"/products/special-offers.html\"`) lacks the aria-label attribute needed for screen readers\n2. **ARIA hierarchy violations**: The sidenav structure using `sp-sidenav` and `sp-sidenav-item` components may have incorrect or missing ARIA role relationships\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` - contains the Special Offers link missing aria-label (lines 96-102)\n- `web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-list.js` - sidenav list component that may need ARIA fixes\n- `da/blocks/sidenav/sidenav.js` - main sidenav implementation with ARIA role handling\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Add aria-label to Special Offers link\n- Update the Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in catalog-sidenav.test.html to include proper aria-label following Milo pattern\n- Add `aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"` attribute\n- Add `target=\"_blank\"` to open in new tab as per the expected pattern\n\n### 2. Fix ARIA role hierarchy in sidenav components\n- Review and fix any missing or incorrect ARIA parent-child role relationships in the sidenav structure\n- Ensure `sp-sidenav` elements have proper role attributes\n- Verify `sp-sidenav-item` elements are properly nested within required parent roles\n\n### 3. Validate changes\n- Run axe accessibility tests to confirm violations are resolved\n- Test with screen readers to verify proper announcements\n- Ensure no new accessibility issues are introduced\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- All ARIA role hierarchy violations on `/products/catalog.html` are resolved (rules: `aria-required-children`, `aria-required-parent`)\n- Special offers link in Resources section includes `aria-label` following the Milo pattern: `aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"`\n- No new axe violations introduced on the page\n- Screen readers can properly identify and announce the Special Offers link target\n\n## Validation Commands\n- `node --check web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html.js` for changed JS files\n- `axe-core` accessibility validation tests\n- Manual screen reader testing for proper announcements","numLines":48,"startLine":1,"totalLines":48}},"tool_use_id":"toolu_015eiMfXwq8RwVRvCCfhCLsp"}}
